cket can overtake. Given that Left is nearing the end of their hand, I need to shed cards quickly while maintaining control. Using the 7s as the attached pair is optimal because both cards are low-mid range and would otherwise be weak singles. This move also avoids wasting higher singles like ♠A or ♣Q as attachments prematurely.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥7", "♦7", "♥9", "♣9", "♦9"]}'}
